<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Bottom wave (optional style): three gentle crests drifting right with a slow swell, one full
     phase cycle per loop (seamless). 16 frames at 12.5 fps. Played by an indeterminate ProgressBar,
     which the launcher animates itself. Hidden (GONE) whenever playback is not active. Decorative. -->
